				type: '(args: { sources: SpaceSource[]; onSubmit: (params: SpaceChatSubmitParams) => void; zeroSourcesBannerAction?: ReactNode; }) => ReactNode',
				description:
					'Render-prop for the chat input area shown below the space content.\n\nDecoupled from `@atlassian/conversation-assistant-chat-prompt-input` to\navoid a runtime dependency cycle between `rovo-spaces` and the chat\nsurface packages. The host (e.g. `SpaceLandingPageContainer`) is\nresponsible for rendering the actual prompt input (`RovoChatPromptInput`)\nand any context banner.\n\nReceives the same `sources` and `onSubmit` the page would have wired\ninternally, so hosts can implement the input however they prefer.\n\nIf omitted, the chat input area is not rendered.',
